~ start
Captain Aldis: Welcome to camp. Raiders hold the ford and the hill pass, and we take both back.
- How do we fight at the ford?
	Captain Aldis: Plan it on the war table. Each soldier moves and acts in turn; keep the cleric close to mend the wounded.
	=> start
- And the pass?
	Captain Aldis: Lead the troops from the muster. Pick out soldiers, send them where they are needed, and they fight on their own.
	=> start
- To work, then.
	Captain Aldis: Good luck out there.
	=> END
